---
import { HeroTerminal } from './react/HeroTerminal';
---

<section id="top" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-14 sm:px-6 lg:pt-20">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-600/25 bg-emerald-500/[0.08] px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">
        Cloudflare 漏洞发现框架 · 单仓库起点
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tighter md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        让编码智能体<br />化身安全审计员
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        六阶段结构化审计，多智能体相互隔离：侦察建账、覆盖搜寻、对抗验证，最后派生目标中立报告。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a href="#install" class="rounded-full bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-500 active:scale-[0.98] dark:bg-emerald-400 dark:text-emerald-950 dark:hover:bg-emerald-300">快速开始</a>
        <a href="#workflow" class="rounded-full border border-zinc-300 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition hover:border-emerald-500/60 hover:text-emerald-700 active:scale-[0.98] dark:border-zinc-700 dark:hover:text-emerald-300">查看工作流</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="mt-8 grid max-w-md grid-cols-4 gap-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-5 dark:border-zinc-800">
        {[
          ['6', '审计阶段'],
          ['11', '攻击面家族'],
          ['3', '判定类别'],
          ['2', '零依赖校验器'],
        ].map(([n, label]) => (
          <div>
            <dt class="sr-only">{label}</dt>
            <dd class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">{n}</dd>
            <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-500">{label}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <HeroTerminal client:visible />
      <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
        源自 <a class="underline decoration-emerald-500/50 underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-300" href="https://blog.cloudflare.com/build-your-own-vulnerability-harness" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">《构建你自己的漏洞发现框架》</a> · 多次运行叠加覆盖，单次约发现累计漏洞的一半
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
